# Paths that hold throwaway keys and tokens on purpose, one regular expression per
# line, anchored at the start of the path. Every one is test data: the DKIM keys
# are generated for the tests, and the tokens are strings the tests feed to the
# parser. A real credential in any of these paths would be a mistake, so the list
# is kept to the exact files and folders, not to "tests/".
^tests/fixtures/dkim/
^src/dkim/test_rsa
^tests/contracts/testdata/
^src/config/dns/tests/provider_build\.rs
^tests/cli/json/cli_json/accounts/account\.rs
^tests/cli/json/cli_json/operator/sweep\.rs
^src/config/dns/tests/empty_credentials\.rs
^tests/cli/json/cli_json/operator/panel\.rs
